# The build context is the whole repo, and Docker does not read .gitignore.
# Without this, `docker build` copies a developer's .env — DATABASE_URL,
# JWT_SECRET, ENCRYPTION_KEY — into the builder stage, which the `migrate`
# target ships verbatim because it is FROM builder with no pruning. Prisma also
# auto-loads .env from the schema directory at migrate time.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Host artefacts: the pnpm symlink farm and stale builds are not reproducible
# against CI's clean checkout, and would be copied over the freshly installed tree.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage

.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
*.log
